Package: fonts-rastikerdar
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Amin Mahmudian <amin@mahmudian.ir>
Installed-Size: 20933
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://rastikerdar.github.io/
Description: collection of Persian and Arabic fonts
 This package provides a collection of Persian and Arabic fonts,
 including Gandom, Nahid, Parastoo, Sahel, Samim, Shabnam,
 Tanha, Vazir Code and Vazirmatn.
 .
 Dedicated to the memory of Saber Rastikerdar (1986-2023),
 whose work made a lasting contribution to Persian digital
 typography.
